            "text": "As a shopper in Sydney, New South Wales, you have several excellent online options for purchasing halal lollies and sweets across Australia. Many of these retailers offer nationwide delivery, ensuring your treats arrive right at your doorstep.\n\nHere are some online stores where you can buy halal lollies:\n\n*   **Sweet As** is a popular choice for premium halal sweets, lollies, and chocolate. Their products are made with certified halal gelatin and are alcohol-free, offering a diverse range suitable for various occasions.\n*   **Global Sweets & Lollies** is described as a leading Australian online store for halal candies, including lollies, gummies, chocolates, and chewy treats. They provide fast delivery services to major cities like Sydney, Brisbane, Melbourne, and Adelaide, as well as other locations across Australia.\n*   **Tiny Sugar Gems** offers 100% halal-certified lollies and gift boxes, emphasizing quick nationwide delivery within Australia.\n*   **Online Lolly Shop (Lolly Warehouse)** explicitly confirms Australia-wide delivery for its halal lollies, including to Sydney, Adelaide, Melbourne, Brisbane, and Perth.\n*   **The Professors Online Lolly Shop** provides a wide selection of halal-certified confectionery, including chewy lollies, hard candies, fruity gummies, and chocolates.\n*   **Paloma Nuts & Confectionery**, a Sydney-based factory, also offers a range of halal-certified lollies and candies with Australia-wide shipping."
